# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-d5432cf82aa39b7e1c9b0da57089be819455e8d0 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-6a15ef12af6f9e9182ed21b7b1603acfb7772334 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].

This implies a time limit for parking in these reserved bays until midday.  